OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after nursery shuts over
OL,4,Achild safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was arrested after a nursery
OL,7,Fwas shut by Ofsted which said it
OL,8,Fbelieved children may be at risk of
OL,9,Fharm, it has emerged.
OL,11,FWonderland Day Nursery in Wednesbury,
OL,12,FWest Midlands, had its licence
OL,13,Fsuspended by regulators Ofsted on 13
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FA woman, 38, was arrested in Willenhall
OL,17,Fon 15 October after police said it
OL,18,Freceived "a report of a care worker
OL,19,Fill-treating or wilfully neglecting an
OL,20,Findividual, at a business in
OL,21,FWednesbury, on 6 October."
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
